  "what_this_does_not_establish": "that the stages are separable costs. Each rung is a different amount of Python over the same kernel launch, so a delta attributes time to code present in one rung and absent in the next -- not to a component that could be removed independently. It also says nothing about device time: every level launches the identical kernel."
